WEBVTT

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.280
Cure Blossom... Cure Marine...

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:29.880
While they collect the Heart Seeds in
 hope of reviving the Great Heart Tree, {Whilst -> While}

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:37.480
we of the Desert Apostles strive to make the human heart wither, and reduce the whole world to desert. {sup Team Magma}

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.890
The Precure pose a great threat to us.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.000
Fear not, Professor Sabark!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.020
Next time, we shall defeat those rookie Precure! {Professor? Really?}

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:51.370
If it was Cure Moonlight you were dealing 
with, then I would understand your failures.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.450
But how many times must you fall to those "rookie" Precure?

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.410
I'm terribly sorry, sir!

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:06.500
Professor Sabark, allow me to dispose of the Precures.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.310
As you wish.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:14.650
However, make sure that you also dispose of all the Heart Seeds they have gathered.

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:15.590
Understood.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:19.200
Hold on just a second! I'll be the one to defeat those Precure!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.140
Well then...

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.970
You can accompany me as my subordinate.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.350
Your subordinate?!

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:26.890
Don't joke around like that!

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:39.430
Well <i>fine</i>! As a special treat, I'll follow your instructions just this once! {Added comma after 'Well'}

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:45.980
{OP}

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.170
HeartCatch

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.630
Precure!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:54.170
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.180
Now, all together

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.650
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:10.270
Within each of our chests,

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.940
they begin to sprout

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.620
The seeds of the heart

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:15.910
are growing

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:18.490
bit by bit

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.160
Red,

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:19.780
white

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.070
and yellow

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.290
all varied colors

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:26.750
that they

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.950
shine so brightly!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.250
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.760
with such care

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.470
will never wither

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.050
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.930
Now, all together

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.390
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.060
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.970
They're always right by our sides

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:56.810
So together

00:02:56.810 --> 00:03:00.660
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.610
bloom even more!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.110
HeartCatch

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.620
Precure!

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:15.340
Erika, you're heavy!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.020
You can do your homework at night!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.090
Hey, let's go for a stroll!

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.510
Can't you solve that using the formula we learned today?

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:30.540
You're as amazing as ever, Erika!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.150
Then let's go on that stroll!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.040
You need a change of pace! {But I'm a 'my pace' kind of guy!}

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:36.820
Shall we go, then?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.600
Chypre, Coffret, you're coming too!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.760
I never knew a place this beautiful was right nearby.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:04:00.790
And it was here that Chypre and 
Coffret came crashing into my life!

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.050
"Crashing"?{You're... learning... *wipes away a single tear*}

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.950
What?! What on earth?!

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.640
It was really shocking!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.950
Really!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.630
I feel so excluded...

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.990
Our meeting might've been somewhat mundane, but that doesn't mean we're not best friends! {Kinda -> Kind of. The slang (ALRIGHT!) version doesn't flow as well with Tsubomi's phrasing here.}

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.440
Best friends!

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.330
Best friends!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.870
If you keep saying we're best friends, you're gonna make me blush!

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.110
But we <i>are</i> best friends!

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.050
It's so pretty...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:44.180
The Desert Apostles are trying to turn the entire world into a desert, right?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.350
That's right!

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:49.120
And to stop that, we need to revive the Great Heart Tree!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.850
That is the duty of the Precure!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:56.600
We'll protect the Flowers of everyone's Hearts from the Desert Apostles,

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.350
and ensure that they all bloom into beautiful flowers!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:04.360
And once we gather a whole bunch of Heart Seeds, we can revive the Great Heart Tree, right? {WHAT IS THIS FAGGOT TREE}

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.790
And that's not all!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.780
A most amazing miracle will occur.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.200
Whoa, what's this amazing miracle?!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.730
Will it, like, go baaaang and
 defeat all the Desert Apostles?!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.340
That's a secret! {That is -> That's}

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:19.000
A secret, huh? Well, I guess that's fine...

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.700
Well then, just how many times are we going to have to defeat the Desert Apostles?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.660
Th-That's also a secret! {That is -> That's}

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.300
W-Well, I guess that's fine...

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.940
The Desert Apostles sure are causing us a lot of trouble...

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:33.680
Though we'll defeat them no matter how many times they appear!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.560
How very rude.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.150
Haven't we been kinda busy lately?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:45.370
Huh? Well, a lot of Desertrians 
<i>have</i> been popping up as of late...

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:49.910
But I really enjoy becoming a Precure!{IT'S AQUARION ALL OVER AGAIN}

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.570
Well, I enjoy it too, but... {as well -> too}

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.750
When you're feeling blue, you need the Heart Perfume!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.710
We'll use a Blue Seed!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.880
The Blessed Perfume of Blue Light!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.800
A spray makes my mood clear up!

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.510
What a lovely fragrance!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.510
Makes me feel like a clear, sunny blue sky.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:18.690
The blue seed's perfume has the ability to make your mood clear right up!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:22.960
Many hardships still lie ahead of you!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:27.190
But if your hearts trust each other, you can overcome any obstacle!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:38.820
Tsubomi, Erika!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.780
Sayaka!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.380
Wow, that's a cute doll!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.050
It is, isn't it?

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.000
Sayaka, do you like this hill as well?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:49.590
Yep!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:53.050
Whenever something good happens to me, I come here!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.560
Something good? What happened?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:00.060
The girls' soccer team has finally 
been accepted as an official club! {Added the apostrophe.}

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.920
That's great news!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:06.650
Yeah, it is! I followed your example and advertised for new members!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.780
Quit that!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.470
The Flower of her Heart shouldn't be shining like that, you damn Precures!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:16.590
Sasorina.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.310
Who is she?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.120
A girl the Precures saved before, Ueshima Sayaka.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:26.230
Oh, the girl whose Flower of the Heart you failed to steal.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:26.980
Wha—

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.120
She's perfect.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.800
Let us taint the Precures' name beyond repair.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:31.990
Huh?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:40.140
The Biggest Predicament Yet<i>!</i>

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:40.140
The Biggest Predicament Yet<i>!</i>

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.760
Erika, would you mind if we watered the 
flowerbed before the Fashion Club meeting?

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:49.070
Sure, that's fine!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:54.280
Today marks the official start of the girls' soccer team! {Added apostrophe.}

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:58.920
And so, as we head toward our tournament debut, I'd like to get straight into training!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:07:59.840
Right!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:03.290
Well then, we'll be your practice partners!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:06.280
We're the girls' soccer team from Desert Junior High! {Added apostrophe. Also oh god what.}

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.500
Who are they?

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.410
I've never heard of them before.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.430
And you really don't look like you're in junior high.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.300
Quit yer yappin'!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.350
We're challenging you to a match!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.360
Well, we were kinda out of luck without practice partners...

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.230
so we accept your challenge!

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.020
Let's go, everyone!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.060
Yeah!

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.070
We'll show you our desert-parched soccer!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.830
Snacky! Cover her in sand!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.040
This is against the rules!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.250
Over here, over here!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.210
Okay!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.470
Desert Sliding Corps!

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:07.900
Captain, shoot!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.080
You're...

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.540
A Precure.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.110
Sayaka!

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.320
Get a hold of yourself!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.800
Who could've done this?!

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.000
It was...

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.490
a Precure.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.320
There's no way a Precure would—

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.820
At any rate, we need to call a teacher!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.720
Right!

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:22.390
We really hate pretty flowers!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:29.020
Just watch, you little humans!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.980
This is the truth behind your beloved Precure!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.020
It's good that nobody was badly hurt.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.950
But just what happened?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.290
Are there other Precure besides us?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.750
Could this mean that Cure Moonlight is still alive?!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.750
Moonlight?!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.040
But why would she do something like that?

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.220
I guess you're right...

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.130
I can hear the voices of the flowers!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.300
The flowers are calling out for help!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.490
This is cruel!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:08.140
Was it you who did this to the flowers?!

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:12.780
You're...

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.810
From our dreams!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:27.790
I was created to destroy the Precure...

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.460
I am Dark Precure.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:34.050
Was it you that hurt these flowers and Sayaka?

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:38.010
I did it to teach you just how
 pointless being a Precure truly is.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.370
My goal is simple.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:52.070
Defeat you Precures, and ensure this world 
becomes a desert, just as Professor Sabark wishes.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.110
Yet you two have no goal at all!

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.800
The likes of you...

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.510
have no chance of defeating me.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.950
Relinquish all your Heart Seeds!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.330
We don't have any Heart Seeds with us!

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:13.540
And we'd never hand them to you even if we did!

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:23.010
Then I suppose I'll have to offer both of these as a trade.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.380
Tsubomi! Erika! Don't come after us!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.980
I shall await you at that water tower.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.900
Chypre! Coffret!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.530
What she said just now really shocked me.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:48.120
About us being Precures despite having no goal?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:48.990
Yeah...

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.790
What the heck are you saying?! {Girls, swearing, etc.}

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.830
We <i>do</i> have a goal, don't we?!

00:12:56.340 --> 00:13:00.210
Right! To make the Flowers of everyone's Hearts bloom into beautiful flowers!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.680
And to gather the Heart Seeds so we can revive the Great Heart Tree!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:07.520
That's right! And that's all we need!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.680
That's why we become Precures and fight!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:11.060
Yeah!

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.200
But really, what are we going to do?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:20.730
If we're going to save Chypre and Coffret, we don't have any choice but to hand over the Heart Seeds.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:25.260
But she isn't just going to give those two back if we just hand it over!

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:29.620
And with them captured, we can't even transform...

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.480
What are we going to do?!

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.330
Can you keep it down?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.040
We're very sorry!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.590
You two get along pretty well together, don't you?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.990
Uh, yeah.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.430
You know what the geranium means in the language of flowers, I take it?

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.050
Yes!

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:51.260
If I recall correctly, it means "true friendship."

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.270
That's just like us, isn't it?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.190
I wonder.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:04.690
I don't think you understand what that really means.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:05.920
Huh?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.590
Hey, wait a second!

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:09.410
What exactly are you getting at?

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.620
You should work that out for yourself.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:21.050
What true friendship really means...

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.420
I guess it means... having trusting hearts?

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:29.130
But if your hearts trust each other, you can overcome any obstacle!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:35.020
Chypre and Coffret have always believed in us and encouraged us to press onward!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.680
And they've risked their lives to protect us!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.690
Now it's our turn to protect them!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.440
Yeah! Even if we're beaten and broken...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.470
...protecting such trusting hearts is why we Precure exist!{pay attention to Coupe's eyes as they turn to face camera} {Oh Coupe, you are the best creepy silent stalker ever.}

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.150
Chypre!

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:58.000
Coffret!

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.370
Stay away, Tsubomi!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.960
You too, Erika!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.670
I commend you for showing up.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.560
You've brought the Heart Seeds?

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:07.880
They're right here!

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:09.770
Then we'll trade...

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:13.350
...is what I'd like to say, but it's such a pain.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:17.310
If I defeat you and take them, then both my problems will be solved.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.400
So they were planning to deceive us! {Fixed the spelling of 'deceive.'}

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.650
We'll have to save Chypre and Coffret before they can steal the Heart Seeds!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.480
They're really underestimating us if they think they can fight us unarmed!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.510
Get them!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.210
Tsubomi!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.120
Erika!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.840
Now, defeat them, and take the Heart Seeds!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.290
Tsubomi!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:51.760
Erika!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.640
It's over.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:03.850
I still don't know who you are, but thank you very much!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.600
Please... Please save them!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.030
Who are you?!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.370
It's that hottie again!

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:16.700
You're...

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:21.000
Not this again! {Hahaha, she's totally standing on two Snackies. Go Sasorina.}

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:26.840
Tsubomi!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.470
Erika!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.090
Tsubomi, let's go!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.010
All right!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:44.690
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.080
Precure!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.650
Open My Heart!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:38.450
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.530
Cure Blossom!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:49.250
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.670
Cure Marine!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.150
HeartCatch Precure!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:05.400
Let's go, Marine! {BUDGEEEEEEEEEEEET STARTOOOOO}

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:06.470
Gotcha!

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:16.570
Had enough yet?!{'mairimashita ka?!' is the worst thing to translate so i am taking the opportunity to be liberal and make Blossom badass} {Her mouth starts moving a tiny bit before this line starts, I think.}

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.700
Precure are the greatest!

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.230
There's a lot more where that came from!

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:31.250
Go get them!

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.030
Let's go for a finisher!{WELL FUCK YOU TOO}

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:44.100
Sounds good!

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:50.000
Precure Grand Explosion! {Sup OP attack. Also we need a screengrab of their RAGEFACES for a splash or front page image somewhere.}

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:55.360
How could this happeeeeeeeeen?!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.400
And now we'll take down Dark Precure!

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:14.670
It's foolish for rookie Precure like
 you to even attempt to defeat me.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.580
We aren't down for the count yet!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.880
We're not gonna lose to the likes of you!

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.470
I know we can win!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:26.110
As long as our hearts trust each other, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.720
What trifling nonsense.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.210
Trusting in each other will not allow you to defeat me.

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.940
Giving it your all will not allow you to defeat me.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.290
No matter what you try, it shall all end in ruin.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.900
Just like it did for Cure Moonlight.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:43.900
Don't look down on Cure Moonlight like that!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.870
An impostor like you could never understand!

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:50.030
Once I destroy you two, I'll become the real thing.

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.530
The wishes that Cure Moonlight entrusted to us

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.830
have always remained within my heart.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:59.880
That's why there's no way...

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.300
that we'll ever accept defeat!

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.000
Marine, let's do this together!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:07.930
Okay!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.440
Gather, Floral Power!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.160
Blossom Tact!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.490
Marine Tact!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.920
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:41.060
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.650
It's the end for you.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.080
Blossom!{Oh fuck Tsubomi with hair down is the cutest thing ever.}

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:06.820
Marine!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.680
Fear not. I shall ease your pain.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:11.040
Dark Power, Gather!

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.300
Dark Tact!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.240
So that's what happened...

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.390
How intriguing.

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:46.000
We're saved...{WAIT, SHIT, SHE ACTUALLY SAID IT}

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:50.170
But... why would Dark Precure just suddenly...

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:09.870
{ED}

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.770
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.690
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.610
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.570
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.120
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.080
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.250
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.710
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.680
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.680
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.520
is about to begin!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.730
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.110
We're pretty

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
at full bloom!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.030
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.080
until it shines

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.620
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.870
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.880
So don't sulk

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.800
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.260
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.350
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:43.360
<i>We have to train!</i>

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:44.110
<i>This is kinda sudden!</i>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:47.440
<i>Now that Dark Precure has appeared, we need to become stronger!</i>

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.860
<i>All right, sounds good to me!</i>

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:49.740
<i>But what should we do?</i>

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:50.650
<i>We must learn kung-fu!</i>

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:51.280
<i>Kung-fu?!</i>

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:54.030
<i>Now, Erika! Don't think, feel!{Best translation.}</i>

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.360
<i>Train your body and mind, and reach new heights!</i>

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.540
<i>Let's kung-fu!</i>

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:00.080
<i>Hah! Tah! Achoooooo!</i>

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:01.790
<i>Ts-Tsubomi's on fire!</i>

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:03.540
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.340
Achoo<i>!</i>

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.340
Achoo<i>!</i>

00:24:06.700 --> 00:24:08.990
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
